            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The efficiency of the desulphurisation is 90 %. All environmental burdens associated with the operation of the scrubber are allocated to the SO2 retained and hence to the power plant. Therefore the produced gypsum is assumed to be burden free, and not explicitly included in the module.;
